cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Lean 4 research and formalization artifacts for the Erdős–Selfridge square-free-moduli problem"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Lubuimi"
    given-names: "Ta-Yoshua"
abstract: >-
  Research software and Lean 4 formalization artifacts for the study, source
  audit, and formal verification programme related to the Erdős–Selfridge
  problem with square-free moduli. The repository includes staged Lean
  developments, reproducible audit workflows, and research documentation.
  The metadata identifies the research software contribution and does not
  claim authorship of the original 2021 theorem.
repository-code: "https://github.com/s4ztz4bnf6-maker/Lubuimi-"
url: "https://github.com/s4ztz4bnf6-maker/Lubuimi-"
keywords:
  - "Lean 4"
  - "formal verification"
  - "Erdős–Selfridge problem"
  - "covering systems"
  - "square-free moduli"
  - "mathematical software"
